@startuml uc_sprint2
title Sprint 2 — Dynamic access control, users and resources

left to right direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam actorBorderColor #808080
skinparam actorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam usecaseBorderColor #808080
skinparam usecaseBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam noteBorderColor #AAAAAA
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam TitleFontSize 13
skinparam TitleFontColor #333333

actor "Administrator\n(ADMIN)"         as Admin

rectangle "PMS Platform" {
  usecase "Assign permissions\nto a role" as UC1
  usecase "Manage user\naccounts" as UC2
  usecase "Record a resource and\nits yearly cost rate" as UC3
  usecase "Authenticate" as UC0
}

Admin --> UC1
Admin --> UC2
Admin --> UC3
UC1 ..> UC0 : <<include>>
UC2 ..> UC0 : <<include>>
UC3 ..> UC0 : <<include>>

note bottom of UC1
  The role--permission matrix is data, not code:
  changing it takes effect without redeployment.
end note

@enduml
